                       </div>\n                                <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-1-1-2\">\n                                    LRU Cache\n                                </h2>\n                                <p class=\"mono text-[10px] muted mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-1-1-3\">\n                                    hard · dsa · 4,203 solves · last edited 2h ago\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"toolbar-btn mono text-[10px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-1-2\" type=\"button\">\n                                <i class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-1-2-1\" data-lucide=\"edit-3\">\n                                </i>\n                                edit\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"px-5 py-4 overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2\">\n                            <div class=\"mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em] faint mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-1\">\n                                markdown preview\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[13px] leading-6 max-w-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2\">\n                                <p class=\"mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-1\">\n                                    Design a data structure that follows the constraints of a\n                                    <span class=\"green-text mono text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-1-1\">\n                                        Least Recently Used\n                                    </span>\n                                    cache.\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mb-4 muted\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-2\">\n                                    Implement\n                                    <span class=\"mono green-text text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-2-1\">\n                                        LRUCache\n                                    </span>\n                                    with a fixed capacity. Every operation must run in constant time.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"code-block p-3 mono text-[11px] leading-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"faint mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-3-1\">\n                                        // interface\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-3-2\">\n                                        <span class=\"green-text\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-3-2-1\">\n                                            get\n                                        </span>\n                                        (key: int) -> int\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-3-3\">\n                                        <span class=\"green-text\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-3-3-1\">\n                                            put\n                                        </span>\n                                        (key: int, value: int) -> void\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-2 faint\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-3-4\">\n                                        // return -1 when key is absent\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-4 border-l-2 border-[var(--amber)] pl-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-4\">\n                                    <div class=\"mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[var(--amber)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-4-1\">\n                                        constraint\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs muted mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-4-2\">\n                                        O(1) average time per operation. Capacity is between 1 and 2,000.\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <aside class=\"bg-[var(--carbon)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-3\">\n                        <div class=\"px-4 py-3 border-b hairline mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em] faint\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-3-1\">\n                            metadata / tests\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 space-y-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-3-2\">\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-3-2-1\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-3-2-1-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] faint\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-3-2-1-1-1\">\n                                        category\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"mono text-xs mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-3-2-1-1-2\">\n                                        dsa\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-3-2-1-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] faint\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-3-2-1-2-1\">\n                                        difficulty\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"mono text-xs mt-1 text-[var(--red)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-5-3-2-1-2-2\">\n                                        hard\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            